Help Desk Support Specialist (Onsite)
Location: Atlanta, GA
Duration: 8 Months

Work Arrangement: 5 Days Onsite – Local Candidates Only
Interview: Web Cam Only

Job Description
We are looking for an experienced Help Desk Support Specialist to provide Tier I and Tier II technical support, troubleshoot hardware/software issues, and assist end users with IT-related problems.

Key Responsibilities
Provide desktop, help desk, and desk-side technical support.
Troubleshoot Windows workstations, applications, and hardware.
Support Microsoft Office 365, Active Directory, and SharePoint.
Manage ServiceNow incident and service request tickets.
Perform desktop imaging, installation, and configuration.
Provide printer support, toner replacement, and print server administration.
Maintain IT inventory and asset management records.
Document resolutions and prepare KPI reports.

Required Skills
Desktop Support – Windows 7/10, Office 365, Adobe Professional (2 years).
Active Directory (2 years).
Printer & Print Server Support (2 years).
Desktop Imaging Management (2 years).
IT Inventory Management (2 years).
Strong troubleshooting and customer service skills.

Preferred Skills
SharePoint Support (2 years).
ServiceNow Incident Management (2 years).
ITIL Service Management knowledge.
Microsoft Exchange, SQL Server, LAN, VPN, and VoIP.

Qualifications
High School Diploma/GED with 2 years of technical support experience, or equivalent education and experience.
Excellent communication and problem-solving skills.
